1
00:00:00,740 --> 00:00:02,000
(Howard:)I'm warning you, Sheldon.

2
00:00:02,209 --> 00:00:03,679
(Sheldon:)Your threats are empty.

3
00:00:03,877 --> 00:00:05,367
(Sheldon:)Nothing can move me.

4
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:08,650
- Stop that!
- Get out of my spot!

5
00:00:08,849 --> 00:00:11,879
(Sheldon:)No. That's it.
I am calling campus security.

6
00:00:12,752 --> 00:00:15,552
(Sheldon:)You prepare for the scolding of your life.

7
00:00:15,755 --> 00:00:17,275
(Leonard:)What are you idiots doing?

8
00:00:17,958 --> 00:00:19,448
(Sheldon:)He's trying to kill me, Leonard.

9
00:00:19,693 --> 00:00:22,853
(Sheldon:)Video games and rock music
have desensitized him to violence.

10
00:00:24,898 --> 00:00:28,268
(Howard:)Would you please talk some sense
into your lunatic roommate?

11
00:00:28,468 --> 00:00:31,438
(Leonard:)You're both acting like lunatics.
It's just a parking spot.

12
00:00:31,671 --> 00:00:32,801
(Howard:)Not just a parking spot.

13
00:00:33,039 --> 00:00:35,939
(Howard:)He can't handle the fact
that I'm a bigger deal than he is now.

14
00:00:36,176 --> 00:00:39,376
(Sheldon:)Oh, preposterous.
I have been solely responsible...

15
00:00:39,579 --> 00:00:42,569
(Sheldon:)...for this university's
six-Ioop quantum gravity calculations.

16
00:00:42,782 --> 00:00:45,812
(Sheldon:)I have changed the way we think
about Bose-Einstein condensates...

17
00:00:46,052 --> 00:00:48,382
(Sheldon:)...and I am also the one
who got Nutter Butters...

18
00:00:48,588 --> 00:00:50,288
(Sheldon:)...in the cafeteria vending machine.

19
00:00:51,725 --> 00:00:57,025
(Sheldon:)Maybe you missed that news while you were
floating around like a goof in outer space.

